 525:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *                     @arg @ref PWR_LOWPOWERREGULATOR_ON
 526:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note   This parameter is not available in this product.
