 635:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c **** /**
 636:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   * @brief  Enter the whole system to Standby mode.
 637:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note   The Standby mode is used to achieve the lowest power consumption
 638:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         with BOR. The internal regulator is switched off so that the VCORE
 639:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         domain is powered off. The PLL, the MSI (MSIS and MSIK) RC, the
 640:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         HSI16 RC and the HSE crystal oscillators are also switched off.
 641:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note   After entering Standby mode, SRAMs and register contents are lost
 642:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         except for registers and backup SRAM in the Backup domain and
 643:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         Standby circuitry. Optionally, the full SRAM2 or 8 Kbytes or 56
ARM GAS  /var/folders/j8/bx6g0dyx2gg_pdn7l_y1sb9c0000gn/T//ccWqwkLl.s 			page 29


 644:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         Kbytes can be retained in Standby mode, supplied by the low-power
 645:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         regulator (Standby with RAM2 retention mode) through
 646:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         HAL_PWREx_EnableSRAM2ContentStandbyRetention().
 647:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note   The state of each I/O during Standby mode can be selected by
 648:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         software : I/O with internal pull-up through
 649:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         HAL_PWREx_EnableGPIOPullUp() and internal pull-down through
 650:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   *         HAL_PWREx_EnableGPIOPullDown().
 651:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   * @retval None.
 652:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr.c ****   */
